    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "SAN FRANCISCO /\nOAKLAND\nEFFECTIVE AUGUST 9, 1954\nUNITED\nRED, WHOTE \u0026 BLUE\nTHE WIDEST CHOICE\nOF SERVICE EVER OFFERED\nNONSTOP TO NEW YORK\nAND WASHINGON\n(see map page)",
      "FOR INFORMATION OR RESERVATIONS CALL\nYOUR TRAVEL AGENT OR UNITED AIR\nLINES.\nSan Francisco\n. EX 7-2100\nOakland....\n834-5800\nJE S-RCC\nMarin County.\n.......DU 8-3774\nPolo site - Mountain Iov\n..............567-6993\nRedwood City....... EM 6-8201\nRichmond.\nBE 5-T3CO\nSan Jose..\n241-8565\nSan Malco.\n-OX 7-7000\nVallejo............. 613-1024\nWalnut Creek..... YE 4-1600\nrou can check your bagoaoe omecty to cesananon transr\nSan Francisco International Airport available at:\nDowntown Airline Terminal\n375 'Farrell Street, San Francisco\nAUGUST-1964\nSEPTEMBER-1964\nSM\n1053\n18\n19\n30\n4:24-SFO-S/64\ncut Ented at your bandaget ist deal!\nSHIP ON UNITED'S\nDC-8F JET FREIGHTERS\nNONSTOP TO CHICAGO\nAND NEW YORK\n(see schedules inside back cover)\nPoore to",
      "VANCOUVER, B. C\nPORTLAND\nSALEMA\nEUGENE\nMEDFORD\nRENO.\nSAN FRANCISCO.\nOAKLAND\nSACRAMENTO\nSTOCKTON\nMONTEREY\nSALINAS\nMERCED\nFRESNO\nVISALIA\nHONOLULU\nSANTA BARBARA\nOS ANGELES\nSAN DIEGO\nUNITED FLIES BY ELGIN WATCH TIME\nSPOKANE\nPENDLETON\nBOISE\nELKO\nELY\nLAS VECAS\nSALT LAKE CITY\nGRAND JUNCTION\nDENVER\nTRANSCONTINENTAL NONSTOP JET SERVICE\nSEATTLE/TACOMA\nSAN FRANCISCO\nPHILADELPHIA\nWASHINGTON\nLOS ANGELES\nMINNEAPOLIS-ST. PAUL\nSAGINAW-BAY Cr\nMUSKESON\nMIDLAND\nROCHESTER\nBOSTON\nFLINT\nGRAND RAPTO\nDETROIT\nWILLTR\nYOUNGSTOWN WARRE\nCEDAR RAPTO\nCAGO\nTOLEDO\nARON CANTO.\nI WAYNE PITTSBURGH\nHARTEORO-SPRINGFIELD\nMIRA-CORNING\nPROVIDENCE\nNEW YORK.\nNEWARK\nWN-BETHLEHEM EASTON\nPHILADEIPHIA\nOMAHA\nMOLINE ROCK ISLAND-DAVENPORT\nDAYTON\nCOLUMBUS\nLINCOLN\nCHARLES ON, W. VA.\nRICHMOND\nBALTIMORE\nWASHINGTON\nNEWPORT NEWS HAMPTON\nWILLIAMSBURG\nNORFOLK PORTSMOUTH\nBRISIOK KINGSPORT-JOHNSON CITY\nKANSAS CUT\nGREENSBORO-HIGH POINT\nWINSTON SALEM\nRALEIGH-DURHAM\nKNOXVILLE\nASHEVILLE\nCHATTANOOGA\nCHARLOTI\nMEMPHIS•\nHUNTSVILL\nATLANTA\nKIK IN HAM\nJACKSON VILLE\nMOBILE\nNEW ORLEANS\nTAMPA.\nST PETERSBURG:\nCLEARWATER\nWEST PALM BEACH\nFORT LAUDERDALE\nMIAMI\nNEW SERVICE ON UNITED • •\nRED, WHITE \u0026 BLUE\nUnited Air Lines introduces the widest choice of services\never offered nonstop to New York and Washington...\nRed, White and Blue ... First Class, Standard and\nCoach ... three choices of service on a single jet.\nChoose Red Carpet First Class for the most luxurious\ntravel ever. Big, wide comfortable seats. Your favorite\nbeverages... gourmet cuisine served course by course.\nAll at the regular First Class price. Or choose Standard\nservice for solid comfort at a close to coach price ...and\nthis includes your choice of beverage and a delicious\nmeal on appropriate fights. And there's Coach for low\ncost service that's comfortable and complete. For reser-\nvations, call United AirLines or see your Travel Agent.\nUNITED\nTHE EXTRA CARE AIRLINE"
